<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Algorithmic Details of SOD</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the complete training procedure of SOD in Algorithm <a href="#algorithm1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ Appendix A Algorithmic Details of SOD ‣ SOD: Step-wise On-policy Distillation for Small Language Model Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. At each iteration, the student generates on-policy trajectories with tool interactions, computes step-level divergence against the teacher, derives adaptive distillation weights, and updates the policy with a combined GRPO and step-wise OPD objective.</p>
</div>
<figure id="algorithm1" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span>SOD: Step-wise On-policy Distillation for Small Language Model Agents</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm1.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span>Student policy <math id="algorithm1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>, teacher policy <math id="algorithm1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\mathrm{teacher}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>teacher</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\mathrm{teacher}}</annotation></semantics></math>, tool environment <math id="algorithm1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}</annotation></semantics></math>, prompt set <math id="algorithm1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math>, group size <math id="algorithm1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>G</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">G</annotation></semantics></math>, smoothing constant <math id="algorithm1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>ϵ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math>, weight cap <math id="algorithm1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\delta</annotation></semantics></math>, clipping range <math id="algorithm1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\epsilon_{\mathrm{clip}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>ϵ</mi><mi>clip</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\epsilon_{\mathrm{clip}}</annotation></semantics></math>.
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span>Trained student policy <math id="algorithm1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>.
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage I: On-Policy Rollout with Tool Interaction</span> 
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.4.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">each prompt <math id="algorithm1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x\in\mathcal{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x\in\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
<ul id="A1.I1" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.5em;">
<li id="A1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=1,\ldots,G" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=1,\ldots,G</annotation></semantics></math>: sample trajectory <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{i}=(y_{1},o_{1},\ldots,y_{K},o_{K},y_{K+1})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>o</mi><mi>K</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{i}=(y_{1},o_{1},\ldots,y_{K},o_{K},y_{K+1})</annotation></semantics></math> from <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\theta_{\mathrm{old}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>old</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\theta_{\mathrm{old}}}</annotation></semantics></math> by interacting with <math id="A1.I1.i1.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{E}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Compute outcome reward <math id="A1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i}=r(\tau_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i}=r(\tau_{i})</annotation></semantics></math> for each trajectory.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Compute group-relative advantage <math id="A1.I1.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{A}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mover accent="true"><mi>A</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{A}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> via <a href="#S3.E2" title="In 3.2 Group Relative Policy Optimization ‣ 3 Preliminaries ‣ SOD: Step-wise On-policy Distillation for Small Language Model Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.6" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage II: Student-teacher Divergence and Step-wise Reweighting</span> 
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm1.4.7.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">each trajectory <math id="algorithm1.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tau_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm1.4.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
<ul id="A1.I2" class="ltx_itemize" style="--ltx-enum-leftmargin:1.5em;">
<li id="A1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Partition model-generated tokens into reasoning steps <math id="A1.I2.i1.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\mathcal{I}_{k}\}_{k=1}^{K+1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℐ</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\mathcal{I}_{k}\}_{k=1}^{K+1}</annotation></semantics></math> (excluding tool observation tokens).</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For each step <math id="A1.I2.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=1,\ldots,K{+}1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=1,\ldots,K{+}1</annotation></semantics></math>, compute step-level divergence <math id="A1.I2.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> via <a href="#S4.E6" title="In 4.2 Student-teacher Divergence and Step-wise Reweighting ‣ 4 Methodology ‣ SOD: Step-wise On-policy Distillation for Small Language Model Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Set <math id="A1.I2.i3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{1}\leftarrow 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{1}\leftarrow 1</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A1.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For <math id="A1.I2.i4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=2,\ldots,K{+}1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=2,\ldots,K{+}1</annotation></semantics></math>, compute adaptive weight <math id="A1.I2.i4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w_{k}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w_{k}</annotation></semantics></math> via <a href="#S4.E7" title="In 4.2 Student-teacher Divergence and Step-wise Reweighting ‣ 4 Methodology ‣ SOD: Step-wise On-policy Distillation for Small Language Model Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Eq.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="algorithm1.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm1.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage III: Combined Optimization</span>

<ul id="A1.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A1.I3.1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item"></span>
<div id="A1.I3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.I3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">[nosep,leftmargin=1.5em]</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A1.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type